DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THE ABOVE
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only.

Data committed under `data/study_areas/` carries the terms of the sources it
was derived from, which are NOT MIT and which travel with the data:

  data/study_areas/uljin_real_v1/
    terrain (dem, slope_deg, aspect_deg)
      Derived from Copernicus DEM GLO-30 Public.
      (C) ESA / Copernicus Programme. Free for the general public under the
      Copernicus DEM licence terms; attribution to ESA / Copernicus required.
      The licence document itself was not retrievable from this repository's
      environment, so its detailed terms are UNVERIFIED HERE -- check them
      before redistributing.

    roads
      Derived from OpenStreetMap.
      (C) OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0
      <https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/>.
      Attribution required <https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright>.
      ODbL is SHARE-ALIKE on derived databases: redistributing this bundle, or
      a database derived from it, carries that obligation.

  data/study_areas/uljin_valley_synthetic_v1/
      Entirely synthetic, generated by this repository. Covered by the MIT
      licence above. It describes no real place.

Per-layer licence terms are recorded machine-readably in each bundle's
`provenance/<layer>.provenance.json` and aggregated in its `manifest.json`
under `licences`. See `docs/DATA_PROVENANCE.md`.
